OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_GymGuy_1::
	.string "JASMINE, the GYM LEADER, is at the\n"
	.string "LIGHTHOUSE.\p"
	.string "She’s been tending to a sick\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "A strong trainer has to be compas-\n"
	.string "sionate.$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_GymGuy_2::
	.string "That was awesome.\p"
	.string "The steel-type, huh?\p"
	.string "That was a close encounter of an\n"
	.string "unknown kind!$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_GymGuy_3::
	.string "JASMINE uses the newly discovered\n"
	.string "steel-type.\p"
	.string "I don’t know very much about it.$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderJasmine2Intro::
	.string "...Thank you for your help at the\n"
	.string "LIGHTHOUSE...\p"
	.string "But this is different. Please\n"
	.string "allow me to introduce myself.\p"
	.string "I am JASMINE, a GYM LEADER. I use\n"
	.string "the steel-type.\p"
	.string "...Do you know about the steel-type?\p"
	.string "It’s a type that was only recently\n"
	.string "discovered.\p"
	.string "...Um... May I begin?$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderJasmine2Defeat::
	.string "...You are a better trainer than me,\n"
	.string "in both skill and kindness.\p"
	.string "In accordance with LEAGUE rules, I\n"
	.string "confer upon you this BADGE.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the MINERALBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderJasmine2_1::
	.string "Um... I don’t know how to say this,\n"
	.string "but good luck...$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderJasmine2_2::
	.string "MINERALBADGE raises POKéMON’s\n"
	.string "DEFENSE.\p"
	.string "...Um... Please take this too...$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_LeaderJasmine2_3::
	.string "...You could use that TM to teach\n"
	.string "IRON TAIL.$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_TeachyTvHost::
	.string "HAHA! This time I beat you!!!\p"
	.string "With my new POKéMON I quickly\n"
	.string "defeated that weak girl!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Huh? You already have 5 BADGES?\p"
	.string "So, you are saying there’s another\n"
	.string "POKéMON GYM across the ocean?\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Crap!\n"
	.string "Never expected that...\p"
	.string "Move it!\n"
	.string "I’m going there!$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_HikerJitouIntro::
	.string "I found my POKéMON in a dark\n"
	.string "mountain!$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_HikerJitouDefeat::
	.string "You are hard as steel...$"

OlivineCity_Interior3_Text_HikerJitou::
	.string "Where was the mountain?\p"
	.string "I don’t quite remember...$"

